stdout:
stderr:
Usage of doctor:
  -grafana string
    	Grafana base URL for live datasource correlation validation
  -grafana-password string
    	Grafana password for basic-auth API checks
  -grafana-token string
    	Grafana service account token for Bearer API checks; takes precedence over basic auth
  -grafana-user string
    	Grafana username for basic-auth API checks
  -json
    	print JSON output
  -loki string
    	Loki base URL (default "http://localhost:3100")
  -prometheus string
    	Prometheus base URL (default "http://localhost:9090")
  -requests int
    	number of synthetic app requests when --url is set (default 3)
  -service string
    	target service.name for correlated telemetry verification
  -tempo string
    	Tempo base URL (default "http://localhost:3200")
  -url string
    	application URL to request for end-to-end telemetry verification
